  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Make-Ahead Turkey Gravy",
  "description": "Flavorful turkey fond is used in Chef John&#39;s fantastic recipe for simple, make-ahead Thanksgiving gravy that&#39;s rich, smooth, and a huge timesaver.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-11-07T19:16:39-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-06-29T12:55:22-04:00",
